1
00:00:07,625 --> 00:00:09,025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:36,665 --> 00:01:39,025
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

3
00:02:10,945 --> 00:02:12,185
Let's sit there.

4
00:02:14,185 --> 00:02:15,025
Excuse me.

5
00:02:19,625 --> 00:02:20,465
Forget it.

6
00:02:20,985 --> 00:02:22,185
Sit there.

7
00:02:24,745 --> 00:02:26,385
Those foreigners keep looking at you.

8
00:02:26,465 --> 00:02:28,145
I'm sure they'll chat you up real soon.

9
00:02:28,825 --> 00:02:29,705
Come on.

10
00:02:29,785 --> 00:02:31,585
You dressed so well today.
They're looking at you, not me.

11
00:02:31,665 --> 00:02:33,145
Yes, look at me.

12
00:02:33,225 --> 00:02:34,425
I can practice my English.

13
00:02:34,505 --> 00:02:37,745
After all, we learn a foreign language
to travel the world.

14
00:02:40,265 --> 00:02:41,225
Luke?

15
00:02:45,865 --> 00:02:47,185
I see you made yourself comfortable.

16
00:02:50,065 --> 00:02:52,465
We are doing Lime proud here.

17
00:02:52,545 --> 00:02:54,225
We prove that Lime girls

18
00:02:54,305 --> 00:02:57,065
are not just smart and capable,
but also beautiful.

19
00:02:58,545 --> 00:02:59,385
Of course.

20
00:02:59,465 --> 00:03:01,265
It's all thanks to your guidance.

21
00:03:01,345 --> 00:03:02,385
Right, boss?

22
00:03:02,465 --> 00:03:03,505
Stop it.

23
00:03:04,025 --> 00:03:05,585
No need to flatter me
when we're on vacation.

24
00:03:06,105 --> 00:03:07,865
Buy us a coconut, perhaps?

25
00:03:07,945 --> 00:03:08,865
No.

26
00:03:10,345 --> 00:03:11,465
‎No worries.

27
00:03:11,545 --> 00:03:12,705
It's my treat. I'll buy some.

28
00:03:13,825 --> 00:03:14,865
I'll come with you.

29
00:03:17,705 --> 00:03:18,745
So stingy.

30
00:03:20,345 --> 00:03:21,185
Hey, beauty.

31
00:03:21,265 --> 00:03:22,785
Would you like some coconut juice?

32
00:03:22,865 --> 00:03:23,705
My treat.

33
00:03:24,865 --> 00:03:28,865
DO WE HAVE A FUTURE?

34
00:03:37,145 --> 00:03:38,065
No need.

35
00:03:42,985 --> 00:03:44,145
Thanks.

36
00:03:47,225 --> 00:03:48,825
Lumi. Help me carry it.

37
00:03:56,105 --> 00:03:56,985
What did I just tell you?

38
00:03:57,065 --> 00:03:58,705
They are into you.

39
00:04:00,785 --> 00:04:02,345
Come, boss.

40
00:04:02,425 --> 00:04:04,185
Have a coconut.

41
00:04:06,025 --> 00:04:07,145
No, thanks.

42
00:04:07,225 --> 00:04:09,225
It's a treat from a handsome guy.
It's not right for me to take it.

43
00:04:09,305 --> 00:04:10,865
Who cares? Just enjoy it. Here.

44
00:04:10,945 --> 00:04:11,865
Try it. Here.

45
00:04:12,545 --> 00:04:13,385
No, thanks.

46
00:04:14,505 --> 00:04:15,585
You didn't get his number?

47
00:04:17,145 --> 00:04:18,785
If we're meant to be,

48
00:04:19,985 --> 00:04:21,025
we'll meet again.

49
00:04:24,145 --> 00:04:25,665
Let's not just sit under the sun.

50
00:04:25,745 --> 00:04:27,665
Should we go shopping?

51
00:04:27,745 --> 00:04:28,585
Sure.

52
00:04:29,105 --> 00:04:30,785
Boss, do you want to join us?

53
00:04:31,305 --> 00:04:32,425
No.

54
00:04:32,505 --> 00:04:34,065
Come with us.

55
00:04:34,905 --> 00:04:36,985
-Why?
-To pay.

56
00:04:38,145 --> 00:04:40,505
No girls who wear this
carry money with them.

57
00:04:42,825 --> 00:04:44,025
Come.

58
00:05:26,865 --> 00:05:28,025
Come.

59
00:05:28,585 --> 00:05:30,665
Are we seriously spending his money?

60
00:05:30,745 --> 00:05:31,585
Yes.

61
00:05:31,665 --> 00:05:33,985
Now is the best time for him
to show off his generosity.

62
00:05:34,065 --> 00:05:36,025
Splurge.

63
00:05:36,105 --> 00:05:36,985
Eat anything you want.

64
00:05:38,625 --> 00:05:39,505
Don't.

65
00:05:42,145 --> 00:05:43,145
Look at this.

66
00:05:43,225 --> 00:05:44,545
Do you want this one?

67
00:06:12,065 --> 00:06:12,905
Come in.

68
00:06:18,505 --> 00:06:20,065
People will see us if you do this.

69
00:06:25,985 --> 00:06:27,265
Don't wear something like this again.

70
00:06:37,065 --> 00:06:38,185
But I love it.

71
00:06:38,985 --> 00:06:40,145
I want to wear it.

72
00:06:45,865 --> 00:06:47,505
Do you do this to everyone?

73
00:06:48,745 --> 00:06:49,585
Do what?

74
00:06:50,705 --> 00:06:51,865
So controlling.

75
00:06:53,025 --> 00:06:53,985
So possessive.

76
00:06:56,025 --> 00:06:59,625
Others can wear or do whatever they want.

77
00:07:00,145 --> 00:07:01,185
That's their freedom.

78
00:07:06,625 --> 00:07:07,665
But not you.

79
00:07:09,225 --> 00:07:11,025
I don't like it when men look at you.

80
00:07:41,105 --> 00:07:42,145
Am I beautiful?

81
00:07:45,465 --> 00:07:46,385
Yes.

82
00:07:49,145 --> 00:07:50,305
Lethally beautiful.

83
00:08:44,305 --> 00:08:45,945
Wait. Wait.

84
00:08:50,345 --> 00:08:51,225
Someone's calling.

85
00:08:55,625 --> 00:08:56,665
Hello?

86
00:08:56,745 --> 00:08:58,345
Flora. Are you free now?

87
00:08:58,425 --> 00:09:00,145
Yes. Why?

88
00:09:02,585 --> 00:09:03,425
Is something the matter?

89
00:09:03,505 --> 00:09:04,665
Nothing.

90
00:09:04,745 --> 00:09:08,545
There's a bug here.

91
00:09:08,625 --> 00:09:09,785
Go ahead.

92
00:09:10,305 --> 00:09:11,705
Come to the lobby bar.

93
00:09:11,785 --> 00:09:13,225
I want to talk to you.

94
00:09:13,305 --> 00:09:15,345
Okay. I'm coming over now.

95
00:09:17,825 --> 00:09:19,625
-Luan Nian.
-Who's that prick

96
00:09:20,145 --> 00:09:21,785
who talks about work
during a team-building exercise?

97
00:09:23,065 --> 00:09:23,905
Alex.

98
00:09:25,945 --> 00:09:26,945
Why didn't you turn him down?

99
00:09:28,065 --> 00:09:29,505
He's my boss.

100
00:09:30,385 --> 00:09:33,865
I need his vote as well
for my promotion next month.

101
00:09:34,665 --> 00:09:37,225
Before you forget, I can vote too.

102
00:09:51,785 --> 00:09:54,065
I'm sure I can win it by myself.

103
00:09:55,705 --> 00:09:57,625
Let's watch the sunrise
by the beach tomorrow.

104
00:09:58,225 --> 00:09:59,065
Okay.

105
00:10:00,305 --> 00:10:02,225
I have to work now.

106
00:10:09,905 --> 00:10:11,105
Luke.

107
00:10:11,185 --> 00:10:13,185
Can we talk? It's an emergency.

108
00:10:14,745 --> 00:10:15,625
Hello?

109
00:10:16,665 --> 00:10:17,945
Alex is quitting.

110
00:10:22,865 --> 00:10:24,745
-He is quitting?
-Yes.

111
00:10:25,305 --> 00:10:26,625
He just tendered his resignation.

112
00:10:27,145 --> 00:10:29,345
Perhaps you should reflect
on your oversight.

113
00:10:30,265 --> 00:10:31,545
Someone poached our manager,

114
00:10:31,625 --> 00:10:33,305
and you didn't even find out.

115
00:10:33,385 --> 00:10:34,265
I admit it is my fault.

116
00:10:34,345 --> 00:10:36,945
We are conducting an internal review
as we speak.

117
00:10:37,025 --> 00:10:38,945
Don't worry. It won't happen again.

118
00:10:39,705 --> 00:10:41,545
-Again?
-Luke.

119
00:10:41,625 --> 00:10:43,545
Alex quit on us on such short notice.

120
00:10:43,625 --> 00:10:45,105
You are rightfully annoyed.

121
00:10:45,185 --> 00:10:46,385
But our priority now

122
00:10:46,465 --> 00:10:49,105
is to minimize the impact
of Alex's resignation.

123
00:10:50,705 --> 00:10:51,985
Where is he going?

124
00:10:52,745 --> 00:10:53,945
Chuangyu.

125
00:10:54,025 --> 00:10:56,025
An up-and-coming startup.

126
00:10:56,105 --> 00:10:59,505
I can suppress the news for now,
but not for long.

127
00:11:00,105 --> 00:11:01,345
He's leaving at the end of this month.

128
00:11:04,705 --> 00:11:05,545
Okay.

129
00:11:06,265 --> 00:11:07,785
Ask him to tie up the loose ends
of his projects

130
00:11:07,865 --> 00:11:09,345
and hand over everything properly.

131
00:11:09,425 --> 00:11:10,505
In exchange,

132
00:11:10,585 --> 00:11:12,865
I will not hold him accountable
for his infringement.

133
00:11:12,945 --> 00:11:14,465
Make sure to contain the rumors.

134
00:11:15,745 --> 00:11:17,505
I do not want our employees to panic.

135
00:11:18,105 --> 00:11:20,945
Understood. I'll talk to him
after you come back.

136
00:11:21,545 --> 00:11:24,505
Also, pay attention
to Division One and Two.

137
00:11:24,585 --> 00:11:26,225
Alex might poach some people as well.

138
00:11:27,585 --> 00:11:30,345
Who do you think he'll poach?

139
00:11:32,105 --> 00:11:33,425
Why me?

140
00:11:34,985 --> 00:11:36,945
You've worked here
for quite some time, Flora.

141
00:11:38,705 --> 00:11:41,105
I've seen what you can do.

142
00:11:41,625 --> 00:11:42,465
Among the new recruits,

143
00:11:43,065 --> 00:11:45,785
you progress the fastest
and have the biggest potential.

144
00:11:46,985 --> 00:11:50,185
I love your learning speed and resilience.

145
00:11:52,825 --> 00:11:54,105
Are you sure?

146
00:11:55,425 --> 00:11:57,465
Lime has so many capable employees.

147
00:11:57,545 --> 00:11:58,585
Besides,

148
00:11:58,665 --> 00:12:01,105
I'm not even an account manager now.

149
00:12:01,185 --> 00:12:03,185
I have not spearheaded any big projects.

150
00:12:03,705 --> 00:12:06,865
How… How can I be helpful to you?

151
00:12:07,945 --> 00:12:09,625
Why are you doubting yourself?

152
00:12:10,225 --> 00:12:11,625
Are you questioning my judgment now?

153
00:12:13,185 --> 00:12:15,065
-No.
-Come.

154
00:12:15,985 --> 00:12:18,065
Let's go through what you've achieved
in the past two years.

155
00:12:18,145 --> 00:12:21,385
You made Lime's supplier database.

156
00:12:22,265 --> 00:12:25,385
You helped Lime close an important deal
with Yueteng Auto.

157
00:12:25,465 --> 00:12:27,185
And you performed wonderfully
in last month's

158
00:12:27,265 --> 00:12:28,865
automotive exhibition show.

159
00:12:28,945 --> 00:12:31,465
Your resume is stellar.

160
00:12:32,505 --> 00:12:34,505
If it weren't for Luan Nian's meddling,

161
00:12:34,585 --> 00:12:36,385
you would have already become an AM.

162
00:12:39,385 --> 00:12:41,825
Honestly, I feel bad for you.

163
00:12:45,225 --> 00:12:47,905
Join me in Chuangyu.

164
00:12:48,745 --> 00:12:51,545
New company, new stage, new opportunity.

165
00:12:51,625 --> 00:12:53,985
I'll give you the position of AM.

166
00:12:54,065 --> 00:12:56,425
Your salary will be doubled,
and you will lead a team yourself.

167
00:12:57,505 --> 00:13:00,305
No stupid rules to confine you.

168
00:13:00,385 --> 00:13:03,185
You can just shine bright.

169
00:13:08,385 --> 00:13:11,385
Alex, I do not intend
to switch jobs for now.

170
00:13:13,305 --> 00:13:14,825
It's just so sudden.

171
00:13:14,905 --> 00:13:18,345
I… I need time to think it over.

172
00:13:18,985 --> 00:13:20,945
You can get back to me
after you think it through.

173
00:13:22,145 --> 00:13:24,145
But keep this between us.

174
00:13:24,225 --> 00:13:25,985
For our sake, as I'm sure you know.

175
00:13:27,025 --> 00:13:28,865
Yes. Don't worry.

176
00:13:29,945 --> 00:13:31,305
The opportunity waits for no one.

177
00:13:57,905 --> 00:13:59,065
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

178
00:14:02,465 --> 00:14:03,745
Thank you, everyone, for joining us.

179
00:14:04,905 --> 00:14:07,905
Other than this trip, your special bonus

180
00:14:07,985 --> 00:14:09,825
will be handed out together
with your salary next month.

181
00:14:13,585 --> 00:14:14,545
Thank you.

182
00:14:14,625 --> 00:14:15,785
-Thank you!
-Thanks, Luke.

183
00:14:16,545 --> 00:14:17,425
Thanks, boss.

184
00:14:23,625 --> 00:14:24,465
Flora.

185
00:14:25,265 --> 00:14:26,505
Alex. Thank you.

186
00:14:33,545 --> 00:14:34,385
Flora.

187
00:14:35,705 --> 00:14:36,825
Alex.

188
00:14:38,705 --> 00:14:39,905
I have to go now.

189
00:14:55,105 --> 00:14:56,505
You talked to Alex?

190
00:14:59,065 --> 00:15:00,265
Yes.

191
00:15:02,625 --> 00:15:03,465
What did you two talk about?

192
00:15:04,345 --> 00:15:06,065
Just work.

193
00:15:28,825 --> 00:15:31,465
Who do you think he'll poach?

194
00:15:33,105 --> 00:15:33,945
Flora.

195
00:15:35,385 --> 00:15:36,425
Flora?

196
00:15:37,345 --> 00:15:39,385
She was transferred from your team.

197
00:15:40,025 --> 00:15:41,985
I'm surprised she got along
with Alex this well.

198
00:15:43,305 --> 00:15:47,185
Her decision to leave with Alex or not
would be the litmus test of your charisma.

199
00:16:01,025 --> 00:16:03,705
SHANG ZHITAO

200
00:16:03,785 --> 00:16:04,905
I'm here.

201
00:16:50,425 --> 00:16:51,425
Flora,

202
00:16:52,385 --> 00:16:53,905
you've been working at Lime
for several years.

203
00:16:54,825 --> 00:16:56,065
How do you feel?

204
00:16:56,985 --> 00:16:59,265
Aren't we supposed to watch the sunrise?

205
00:16:59,345 --> 00:17:00,745
Why are we talking about work?

206
00:17:03,585 --> 00:17:06,265
I'm grateful for this opportunity

207
00:17:07,184 --> 00:17:12,424
and grateful that your strict guidance
has allowed me to grow rapidly.

208
00:17:14,944 --> 00:17:16,025
Grateful?

209
00:17:22,825 --> 00:17:24,305
Is there nothing else you want to tell me?

210
00:17:28,985 --> 00:17:30,185
No.

211
00:17:36,745 --> 00:17:37,665
Luan Nian.

212
00:17:39,425 --> 00:17:41,945
I'm happy that we get to watch
the sunrise together.

213
00:17:42,785 --> 00:17:44,305
But I hope…

214
00:17:48,825 --> 00:17:51,105
not just the sunrise.

215
00:17:51,985 --> 00:17:54,145
I want to watch the sunset with you too.

216
00:17:56,545 --> 00:17:57,745
Now, I'm done.

217
00:18:35,385 --> 00:18:36,665
The sunrise is so beautiful.

218
00:18:37,185 --> 00:18:41,945
To watch the sunrise with him feels great.

219
00:18:49,345 --> 00:18:52,785
Half of my feelings for him are love.

220
00:18:53,305 --> 00:18:56,705
And the other half
is admiration and respect.

221
00:19:01,505 --> 00:19:02,505
At this moment,

222
00:19:04,225 --> 00:19:06,585
he's standing so close to me.

223
00:19:07,745 --> 00:19:12,505
But this is something
I can't say out loud or hide.

224
00:19:55,225 --> 00:19:56,065
All right.

225
00:19:56,145 --> 00:19:57,345
Let's call it a day.

226
00:19:57,425 --> 00:19:59,625
Compile everything and send it to me
as soon as possible.

227
00:19:59,705 --> 00:20:01,225
-Dismissed.
-I will double check.

228
00:20:01,305 --> 00:20:02,785
-Okay.
-Sorry.

229
00:20:02,865 --> 00:20:03,865
We'll only take up a few minutes.

230
00:20:04,665 --> 00:20:07,345
We have an announcement to make.

231
00:20:10,425 --> 00:20:14,145
Today is my last day at Lime.

232
00:20:18,705 --> 00:20:22,985
I am grateful for your support
and understanding in my journey.

233
00:20:24,065 --> 00:20:26,505
Before the new business manager arrives,

234
00:20:27,025 --> 00:20:30,705
Luke will temporarily
take over Business Division Two.

235
00:20:33,705 --> 00:20:34,985
You have my blessings, Alex.

236
00:20:36,185 --> 00:20:37,545
After I became the general manager,

237
00:20:37,625 --> 00:20:39,945
I am grateful for your support

238
00:20:40,025 --> 00:20:42,425
and the support
from the Customer Service Division.

239
00:20:43,025 --> 00:20:45,305
You have led a formidable team.

240
00:20:46,065 --> 00:20:47,705
I'll leave the floor to all of you.

241
00:20:54,025 --> 00:20:56,985
I reserved a restaurant nearby
for Alex's farewell party.

242
00:20:57,625 --> 00:20:59,545
Join us if you are free.

243
00:21:00,225 --> 00:21:01,505
Thank you, Tracy.

244
00:21:02,145 --> 00:21:02,985
All the best, Alex.

245
00:21:03,065 --> 00:21:04,225
All the best, Alex.

246
00:21:05,225 --> 00:21:06,825
I am honored

247
00:21:08,065 --> 00:21:09,905
to have worked with all of you

248
00:21:10,505 --> 00:21:11,825
all these years.

249
00:21:18,585 --> 00:21:20,665
Don't sulk.

250
00:21:20,745 --> 00:21:22,425
I'm just changing my job.

251
00:21:23,625 --> 00:21:25,625
When you're free, hang out with me.

252
00:21:26,225 --> 00:21:28,105
We can eat or drink.

253
00:21:28,185 --> 00:21:29,945
Let's drink to your heart's content today.

254
00:21:30,025 --> 00:21:30,865
-Okay.
-Okay.

255
00:21:30,945 --> 00:21:32,585
-All right.
-Thanks, Alex.

256
00:21:32,665 --> 00:21:33,905
Thanks, Alex.

257
00:21:34,905 --> 00:21:36,585
See you at the restaurant.

258
00:21:36,665 --> 00:21:38,065
Go back to your work.

259
00:21:49,265 --> 00:21:50,105
-Hi, Alex.
-Alex.

260
00:21:50,185 --> 00:21:51,025
A toast to you.

261
00:21:51,105 --> 00:21:52,305
-A toast to you.
-Together.

262
00:21:52,385 --> 00:21:53,265
Thank you.

263
00:21:53,345 --> 00:21:54,785
May all go well in your next position.

264
00:21:54,865 --> 00:21:56,025
Good luck.

265
00:21:59,305 --> 00:22:00,865
Alex was doing so well.

266
00:22:00,945 --> 00:22:02,265
Why did he leave?

267
00:22:03,265 --> 00:22:04,625
To seek greener pastures.

268
00:22:07,145 --> 00:22:08,825
There's a place better than Lime?

269
00:22:09,425 --> 00:22:11,025
Will you work at Lime forever?

270
00:22:12,545 --> 00:22:17,305
To him, the greener pastures
mean better pay,

271
00:22:17,385 --> 00:22:19,385
bigger space, and more resources.

272
00:22:22,345 --> 00:22:25,505
Then why didn't Lime
give him a counter-offer?

273
00:22:27,425 --> 00:22:28,945
We did.

274
00:22:29,625 --> 00:22:30,465
During the team-building exercise,

275
00:22:30,545 --> 00:22:32,865
Luke talked to him. It didn't go well.

276
00:22:32,945 --> 00:22:34,865
So be it then.

277
00:22:36,265 --> 00:22:39,225
But to Luke,
Lime is never lacking in talent.

278
00:23:01,185 --> 00:23:02,425
I was looking for you.

279
00:23:03,465 --> 00:23:05,945
I know who Alex is taking with him.

280
00:23:06,545 --> 00:23:07,905
Who?

281
00:23:09,305 --> 00:23:10,825
Du Anni and Li Tianran.

282
00:23:11,665 --> 00:23:12,825
Both of them are idiots.

283
00:23:13,785 --> 00:23:15,105
Once they leave Lime,

284
00:23:15,185 --> 00:23:18,385
they'll realize they owe
their stellar achievements

285
00:23:18,465 --> 00:23:19,985
to this company.

286
00:23:22,105 --> 00:23:26,265
Lumi, if it were you, would you leave?

287
00:23:27,665 --> 00:23:29,625
Is this a joke? Why would I leave?

288
00:23:30,265 --> 00:23:32,465
A new place means I have to adapt
to a new environment.

289
00:23:33,065 --> 00:23:34,305
I'm comfortable in Lime.

290
00:23:34,385 --> 00:23:36,505
I've adapted to this place. I own it.

291
00:23:36,585 --> 00:23:37,785
People let me do what I want.

292
00:23:45,665 --> 00:23:49,145
Job-hopping has its pros and cons.

293
00:23:50,545 --> 00:23:53,345
If you leave with him,
you're forever his subordinate.

294
00:23:53,425 --> 00:23:55,385
If he succeeds, you'll be successful.

295
00:23:56,105 --> 00:23:59,105
If he fails, you have to start all over.

296
00:23:59,905 --> 00:24:03,585
But if you stay,
you have to face the new boss.

297
00:24:04,545 --> 00:24:07,705
You don't know if you'll be sidelined.

298
00:24:08,985 --> 00:24:10,505
But as long as you stay in Lime,

299
00:24:10,585 --> 00:24:13,225
Luke will protect you.

300
00:24:15,985 --> 00:24:16,865
Why?

301
00:24:17,465 --> 00:24:19,785
Because Yueteng has retained us.

302
00:24:20,305 --> 00:24:22,065
And you know them very well.

303
00:24:25,265 --> 00:24:26,265
Right?

304
00:24:36,225 --> 00:24:38,385
-Shall we grab a cab?
-My boyfriend is picking my up.

305
00:24:38,465 --> 00:24:40,545
-Bye then.
-Bye.

306
00:24:40,625 --> 00:24:41,665
Flora.

307
00:24:42,345 --> 00:24:43,185
Alex.

308
00:24:45,905 --> 00:24:47,705
You know I want you to come with me.

309
00:24:47,785 --> 00:24:49,585
On top of what I said last time,

310
00:24:50,785 --> 00:24:51,905
there's also a personal reason.

311
00:25:03,385 --> 00:25:04,985
I'll get back to you as soon as possible.

312
00:25:36,985 --> 00:25:38,865
If Alex wants you to go with him,

313
00:25:38,945 --> 00:25:40,345
there can only be two reasons.

314
00:25:40,425 --> 00:25:42,145
You're cheap and obedient.

315
00:25:47,265 --> 00:25:51,705
So even now, that's how he sees me.

316
00:26:31,745 --> 00:26:34,785
If you're leaving,
please tell me beforehand.

317
00:26:35,985 --> 00:26:39,665
I'll talk to HR
and terminate your position.

318
00:26:39,745 --> 00:26:42,785
That way, you can get your severance pay.

319
00:26:45,945 --> 00:26:47,145
Thank you.

320
00:26:47,225 --> 00:26:49,945
Once I have made up my mind,
I'll let you know beforehand.

321
00:26:54,105 --> 00:26:55,945
So you truly are considering
taking up Alex's offer?

322
00:27:00,145 --> 00:27:02,105
He gave you that offer
at Phuket, didn't he?

323
00:27:02,865 --> 00:27:04,305
What did he tell you?

324
00:27:04,385 --> 00:27:06,225
That you would be successful
if you followed him?

325
00:27:06,305 --> 00:27:08,985
That your salary would double
and you would get promoted in a year?

326
00:27:14,265 --> 00:27:15,665
Shang Zhitao, do you have a brain?

327
00:27:17,025 --> 00:27:18,865
Are you trying to fish out
an answer from me?

328
00:27:20,425 --> 00:27:23,105
I wouldn't have to do this
if you didn't lie to me.

329
00:27:27,465 --> 00:27:29,505
I gave you a chance
just now and in Phuket.

330
00:27:29,585 --> 00:27:31,625
But you chose to lie.

331
00:27:32,345 --> 00:27:34,145
Are you that eager to leave with him?

332
00:27:35,505 --> 00:27:37,425
You are not my direct superior.

333
00:27:37,505 --> 00:27:39,225
I would be going over
my superior's head otherwise.

334
00:27:41,905 --> 00:27:44,385
If you want to talk about rules,

335
00:27:44,465 --> 00:27:45,985
according to the company policy,

336
00:27:46,705 --> 00:27:48,905
management-level employees
cannot poach any staff members

337
00:27:48,985 --> 00:27:50,345
as it constitutes unfair competition.

338
00:27:51,345 --> 00:27:52,945
You've signed the non-compete agreement.

339
00:27:53,665 --> 00:27:56,665
Since Alex loves to play dirty,

340
00:27:56,745 --> 00:27:58,385
what do you think
our legal team will do to him?

341
00:28:14,345 --> 00:28:16,545
Shang Zhitao, do you know
what your fundamental problem is?

342
00:28:18,025 --> 00:28:19,305
You do not have a firm principle.

343
00:28:20,225 --> 00:28:21,545
You are young.

344
00:28:21,625 --> 00:28:23,545
How can you let small gains entice you?

345
00:28:23,625 --> 00:28:25,065
Have you thought about your future?

346
00:28:26,025 --> 00:28:27,785
Or are you a shortsighted person

347
00:28:27,865 --> 00:28:29,625
who only sees
the benefits in front of you?

348
00:28:31,345 --> 00:28:32,305
Mr. Luan.

349
00:28:32,985 --> 00:28:34,025
My future?

350
00:28:34,825 --> 00:28:36,785
If I want a future, I need money.

351
00:28:36,865 --> 00:28:38,745
I'm not like you.

352
00:28:38,825 --> 00:28:40,225
You're used to your lofty palace.

353
00:28:40,305 --> 00:28:42,745
That's why you can think
about your future.

354
00:28:42,825 --> 00:28:45,425
I came to Beijing alone
and rented a place with flatmates.

355
00:28:45,505 --> 00:28:47,545
I am cheap and obedient.

356
00:28:47,625 --> 00:28:49,505
It takes three hours
to travel to the office back and forth.

357
00:28:49,585 --> 00:28:54,465
My happiness is decided by cheap things,
like my commute and wage.

358
00:28:54,545 --> 00:28:56,985
Alex told me that the new company
was close to my home.

359
00:28:57,065 --> 00:28:58,905
How can I not be enticed?

360
00:29:02,705 --> 00:29:04,465
Will you even understand my situation?

361
00:29:04,545 --> 00:29:05,905
Can you even empathize?

362
00:29:06,945 --> 00:29:08,465
Besides, this is my private matter.

363
00:29:08,545 --> 00:29:09,425
I don't need your intervention.

364
00:29:11,505 --> 00:29:13,465
You think I want to care about you?

365
00:29:14,185 --> 00:29:16,505
I wouldn't have had to say all this
if you had used your brain once.

366
00:29:16,585 --> 00:29:18,585
Did I beg for your advice?

367
00:29:21,785 --> 00:29:23,145
You want my answer, don't you?

368
00:29:23,225 --> 00:29:25,385
Then, listen carefully.

369
00:29:25,945 --> 00:29:28,225
I'm leaving with Alex. Why?

370
00:29:28,305 --> 00:29:30,505
Because he supports me.
He talks to me nicely.

371
00:29:30,585 --> 00:29:31,505
He respects me.

372
00:29:34,825 --> 00:29:35,905
I wish you all the best.

373
00:29:35,985 --> 00:29:36,905
I will do my best.

374
00:30:00,745 --> 00:30:02,865
Not strong or firm enough.

375
00:30:03,905 --> 00:30:06,505
Cheap. Obedient. Docile.

376
00:30:07,185 --> 00:30:08,945
How can you let small gains entice you?

377
00:30:09,025 --> 00:30:10,385
Have you thought about your future?

378
00:30:10,905 --> 00:30:13,025
Or are you a shortsighted person

379
00:30:13,105 --> 00:30:14,785
who only sees
the benefits in front of you?

380
00:30:14,865 --> 00:30:17,505
Reckless. Didn't think it through. Eager.

381
00:30:21,145 --> 00:30:22,825
LUAN NIAN
IF ALEX WANTS YOU TO GO WITH HIM

382
00:30:22,905 --> 00:30:24,265
THERE CAN ONLY BE TWO REASONS

383
00:30:24,345 --> 00:30:25,705
YOU ARE CHEAP AND OBEDIENT

384
00:30:29,825 --> 00:30:31,945
LUKE

385
00:30:35,145 --> 00:30:36,345
SETTINGS

386
00:30:36,425 --> 00:30:37,585
BLOCK USER

387
00:30:37,665 --> 00:30:38,625
BLOCK

388
00:30:38,705 --> 00:30:39,785
BLOCKED

389
00:31:03,425 --> 00:31:05,585
Why are you following me?

390
00:31:18,945 --> 00:31:20,385
Were you abandoned too?

391
00:31:25,505 --> 00:31:26,865
Dirty fella.

392
00:31:29,545 --> 00:31:32,425
I'll help you find
your owner tomorrow, okay?

393
00:31:36,985 --> 00:31:37,825
Come.

394
00:31:47,865 --> 00:31:49,585
I love the renovation.

395
00:31:50,185 --> 00:31:51,625
Very artsy.

396
00:31:52,145 --> 00:31:53,585
How did you find the designer?

397
00:31:56,265 --> 00:31:58,145
The renovation fee must be…

398
00:32:00,145 --> 00:32:01,385
What's the matter?

399
00:32:01,985 --> 00:32:03,865
Work or girls? Tell me.

400
00:32:04,945 --> 00:32:06,385
Remember Alex?

401
00:32:07,745 --> 00:32:10,105
Shang Zhitao is following Alex
to his new job.

402
00:32:10,705 --> 00:32:11,785
And she lied to me.

403
00:32:12,985 --> 00:32:14,225
I confronted her,

404
00:32:14,305 --> 00:32:15,665
and she said she shouldn't go
over her superior's head.

405
00:32:21,145 --> 00:32:22,465
In my eyes,

406
00:32:23,065 --> 00:32:25,985
Ms. Shang is more rational than you are.

407
00:32:27,225 --> 00:32:28,065
You see.

408
00:32:28,585 --> 00:32:30,505
If people mix work and private life,

409
00:32:30,585 --> 00:32:32,745
there will be no order.

410
00:32:32,825 --> 00:32:35,305
Forget about the relationship.

411
00:32:35,385 --> 00:32:36,945
She is just your subordinate.

412
00:32:37,025 --> 00:32:39,345
She can choose where she wants to work.

413
00:32:40,185 --> 00:32:41,785
So I just watch her
as she makes the wrong decision?

414
00:32:44,265 --> 00:32:47,225
She's just young and reckless.

415
00:32:47,985 --> 00:32:49,545
She gets enticed by the smallest benefit.

416
00:32:50,065 --> 00:32:52,585
A job does not fall into your lap.

417
00:32:53,505 --> 00:32:56,385
You sound like your father.

418
00:32:58,065 --> 00:33:00,585
Easy. Think positively.

419
00:33:01,705 --> 00:33:03,265
If she leaves Lime,

420
00:33:03,825 --> 00:33:06,145
you no longer have to hide
your relationship anymore.

421
00:33:06,225 --> 00:33:07,425
It's a good thing.

422
00:33:10,305 --> 00:33:11,185
Luan Nian.

423
00:33:11,825 --> 00:33:14,585
Ask yourself truthfully.

424
00:33:16,025 --> 00:33:18,865
Are you worried that she'll leave Lime

425
00:33:19,545 --> 00:33:21,465
or that she'll leave you?

426
00:33:24,145 --> 00:33:27,265
Regardless of her choice,
I hope you can respect her.

427
00:33:27,905 --> 00:33:29,945
Because she is an independent person.

428
00:33:32,545 --> 00:33:34,105
If you don't want to lose her,

429
00:33:34,985 --> 00:33:36,145
win her back,

430
00:33:36,665 --> 00:33:39,385
and not just push her away
in a hurtful way.

431
00:34:00,985 --> 00:34:02,025
STUDIO

432
00:34:06,985 --> 00:34:10,625
Spent all 200,000 yuan your mom gave you?

433
00:34:12,705 --> 00:34:17,905
I must say, it's a miracle
that the motley crew of yours

434
00:34:17,985 --> 00:34:19,344
lasted three months.

435
00:34:22,985 --> 00:34:24,105
Why?

436
00:34:24,185 --> 00:34:26,465
Can't take a comment after you failed?

437
00:34:27,065 --> 00:34:29,665
How can you start a business
when you're this sensitive?

438
00:34:30,425 --> 00:34:32,945
Do you think business grows on trees?

439
00:34:33,465 --> 00:34:35,225
How naive.

440
00:34:35,304 --> 00:34:37,025
Starting a business
is not as simple as you think.

441
00:34:37,105 --> 00:34:38,145
The world outside is complicated.

442
00:34:39,065 --> 00:34:41,744
You refused to believe me
and took up a fool's errand.

443
00:34:43,225 --> 00:34:45,304
So for a successful entrepreneur like you,

444
00:34:45,385 --> 00:34:48,145
you only judge people
by how much money they make?

445
00:34:50,225 --> 00:34:52,264
It is not the only standard,

446
00:34:52,344 --> 00:34:54,225
but it's the bare minimum.

447
00:34:54,304 --> 00:34:56,344
Your company didn't make any money.

448
00:34:56,425 --> 00:34:57,825
It was a net loss.

449
00:34:57,905 --> 00:34:59,705
Who are you to judge my standard?

450
00:35:02,225 --> 00:35:03,985
If nothing I do pleases you,

451
00:35:04,705 --> 00:35:07,625
why did you lie that Mom was sick
and ask me to come back?

452
00:35:08,745 --> 00:35:10,545
Why are you two fighting again?

453
00:35:10,625 --> 00:35:12,825
Can't you talk properly?

454
00:35:14,985 --> 00:35:16,225
It's okay.

455
00:35:16,305 --> 00:35:17,665
You don't have to worry about me anymore.

456
00:35:17,745 --> 00:35:19,225
From now on, whether I live or die
has nothing to do with you.

457
00:35:19,305 --> 00:35:21,825
If you use my money, it is my business.

458
00:35:21,905 --> 00:35:23,505
Hush already.

459
00:35:23,585 --> 00:35:24,425
Look at you.

460
00:35:24,505 --> 00:35:26,785
What do you have other than a box?

461
00:35:26,865 --> 00:35:27,865
Enough!

462
00:35:27,945 --> 00:35:29,265
It's not your money.

463
00:35:29,345 --> 00:35:30,545
Luan Nian did the right thing.

464
00:35:30,625 --> 00:35:32,025
I support your decision.

465
00:35:32,105 --> 00:35:33,585
You have my support.

466
00:35:33,665 --> 00:35:34,785
-Let's go back inside.
-Mom.

467
00:35:34,865 --> 00:35:36,065
Two hundred thousand yuan.

468
00:35:36,145 --> 00:35:38,265
I'll repay you together with the interest.

469
00:35:38,345 --> 00:35:39,865
Luan Nian. Luan Nian.

470
00:35:39,945 --> 00:35:40,985
Luan Nian! You…

471
00:36:00,665 --> 00:36:02,545
STUDIO

472
00:36:06,425 --> 00:36:11,265
Are you worried that she'll leave Lime
or that she'll leave you?

473
00:36:12,225 --> 00:36:13,905
If you don't want to lose her,

474
00:36:14,505 --> 00:36:15,785
win her back,

475
00:36:16,305 --> 00:36:19,305
and not just push her away
in a hurtful way.

476
00:36:19,385 --> 00:36:21,025
Shang Zhitao, do you have a brain?

477
00:36:21,105 --> 00:36:22,225
Have you thought about your future?

478
00:36:22,305 --> 00:36:23,825
Or are you a shortsighted person?

479
00:36:23,905 --> 00:36:26,305
I'm leaving with Alex. Why?

480
00:36:26,385 --> 00:36:28,505
Because he supports me.
He talks to me nicely.

481
00:36:28,585 --> 00:36:29,425
He respects me.

482
00:36:42,465 --> 00:36:43,745
Sorry.

483
00:36:43,825 --> 00:36:46,585
The number you called cannot be reached.

484
00:36:46,665 --> 00:36:48,025
Please try again later.

485
00:36:54,505 --> 00:36:58,305
SHANG ZHITAO, WHERE ARE YOU?

486
00:36:58,385 --> 00:36:59,225
THE USER HAS BLOCKED YOUR MESSAGE

487
00:37:09,705 --> 00:37:12,345
Do you think business grows on trees?

488
00:37:12,425 --> 00:37:13,945
How naive.

489
00:37:14,025 --> 00:37:15,145
You took up a fool's errand.

490
00:37:22,985 --> 00:37:25,145
How did I become
the person I hate the most?

491
00:37:45,625 --> 00:37:47,105
It's so solemn in here.

492
00:37:47,185 --> 00:37:48,145
I almost thought

493
00:37:48,225 --> 00:37:49,665
Division Two were getting disbanded.

494
00:37:54,585 --> 00:37:55,705
Report your work to me.

495
00:37:58,745 --> 00:37:59,585
Shang Zhitao.

496
00:38:01,105 --> 00:38:03,865
You're doing the market analytics
for global new media.

497
00:38:03,945 --> 00:38:05,305
How is the progress?

498
00:38:07,065 --> 00:38:09,505
I have collected the necessary data

499
00:38:09,585 --> 00:38:13,265
and will add domestic suppliers
into our media database.

500
00:38:15,025 --> 00:38:18,665
Our rivals are posturing
to enter the new media market.

501
00:38:18,745 --> 00:38:20,385
We have to act quickly now.

502
00:38:21,025 --> 00:38:22,585
How long do you think you need?

503
00:38:24,145 --> 00:38:25,065
A month.

504
00:38:26,585 --> 00:38:29,665
If you can finish it in two weeks,
we'll have the edge.

505
00:38:30,665 --> 00:38:31,585
Can you do it?

506
00:38:37,065 --> 00:38:39,345
Given that we are currently short-staffed,

507
00:38:40,825 --> 00:38:42,745
I am unable to make that promise.

508
00:38:50,425 --> 00:38:52,145
We'll stick to the same goal.

509
00:38:52,225 --> 00:38:53,465
Two weeks.

510
00:38:54,105 --> 00:38:56,185
I'll assign people
from other teams to assist you.

511
00:38:57,345 --> 00:38:58,185
Sit down.

512
00:39:13,145 --> 00:39:16,345
Flora, I can tell you have thought
carefully about your work.

513
00:39:18,385 --> 00:39:20,865
Not only do you work hard,
you have a plan too.

514
00:39:21,945 --> 00:39:22,785
Keep it up.

515
00:39:34,025 --> 00:39:34,985
Flora.

516
00:39:39,505 --> 00:39:40,465
You've changed.

517
00:39:41,105 --> 00:39:42,505
You said no to Luke,

518
00:39:42,585 --> 00:39:44,945
and somehow, he didn't rebut you.

519
00:39:45,025 --> 00:39:46,065
He even praised you.

520
00:39:48,185 --> 00:39:50,945
I was just telling the truth.

521
00:39:53,345 --> 00:39:59,145
Did you tell him you couldn't make it
because you have decided to join Alex?

522
00:40:02,985 --> 00:40:04,745
Let me tell you the truth.

523
00:40:04,825 --> 00:40:06,945
I have not made the decision yet.

524
00:40:07,025 --> 00:40:10,905
I said what I said in the meeting
because it truly is beyond my capability.

525
00:40:14,745 --> 00:40:15,745
Listen.

526
00:40:16,985 --> 00:40:20,305
Personally, I don't want you to leave.

527
00:40:21,225 --> 00:40:26,105
Be it at work or hanging out as friends,
you are an amazing person.

528
00:40:26,185 --> 00:40:30,225
But you decide
if you want to stay or leave.

529
00:40:30,905 --> 00:40:34,145
You are so bright,
you'll shine wherever you go.

530
00:40:37,025 --> 00:40:41,945
You truly think I… I'm very good?

531
00:40:42,025 --> 00:40:44,465
Yes. You're amazing.

532
00:40:44,985 --> 00:40:46,985
Why else did Alex make you that offer?

533
00:40:51,625 --> 00:40:53,105
I will respect your decision.

534
00:41:04,345 --> 00:41:06,065
WORK HARD IN OCTOBER AS WELL!

535
00:41:09,505 --> 00:41:11,705
DAILY ENGLISH STUDY PLAN
CALL THE SUPPLIER

536
00:41:11,785 --> 00:41:12,705
MONTHLY WORK PLAN

537
00:41:13,625 --> 00:41:14,865
I found a job.

538
00:41:14,945 --> 00:41:16,145
Lime!

539
00:41:16,225 --> 00:41:17,785
I got this from Yonghe Palace.

540
00:41:17,865 --> 00:41:19,545
It'll boost your career.

541
00:41:20,145 --> 00:41:22,705
I can't even follow the meeting minutes.

542
00:41:22,785 --> 00:41:24,105
They used so much jargon,

543
00:41:24,705 --> 00:41:25,865
and I don't know them.

544
00:41:25,945 --> 00:41:28,145
I want to master them in a week.

545
00:41:28,665 --> 00:41:30,225
THURSDAY 6 P.M.
STARRY COFFEE SHOP, ENGLISH TUITION

546
00:41:30,305 --> 00:41:32,905
When it comes to language,
speaking especially,

547
00:41:32,985 --> 00:41:34,665
being good at imitating is a perk

548
00:41:34,745 --> 00:41:36,185
because it means you'll learn well.

549
00:41:36,865 --> 00:41:39,185
Spare your gratitude and apologies.

550
00:41:39,265 --> 00:41:40,225
We don't need them at work.

551
00:41:42,225 --> 00:41:43,065
Sir.

552
00:41:43,705 --> 00:41:45,745
I'm Shang Zhitao from Lime Advertising.

553
00:41:45,825 --> 00:41:48,225
We managed to secure
an annual retainer contract

554
00:41:48,305 --> 00:41:49,865
with Mulanshuo.

555
00:41:51,545 --> 00:41:52,785
EXCEL FORMULAS GUIDE

556
00:41:52,865 --> 00:41:54,705
We will categorize suppliers
into three groups.

557
00:41:54,785 --> 00:41:59,905
Each category will be graded
on different criteria.

558
00:42:00,665 --> 00:42:02,745
As the project manager,

559
00:42:02,825 --> 00:42:04,225
I take full responsibility.

560
00:42:04,305 --> 00:42:05,545
I accept any punishment from the company.

561
00:42:06,225 --> 00:42:08,265
Your event was a success.

562
00:42:08,345 --> 00:42:12,265
Everyone in Lime knows your name now.

563
00:42:16,225 --> 00:42:17,665
SUN YU

564
00:42:21,505 --> 00:42:22,345
Sun Yu.

565
00:42:23,265 --> 00:42:25,025
Tao. Something bad happened.

566
00:42:25,745 --> 00:42:26,665
What?

567
00:42:54,545 --> 00:42:55,705
Done.

568
00:42:55,785 --> 00:42:56,865
I'll send them out.

569
00:43:00,065 --> 00:43:00,905
Flora.

570
00:43:00,985 --> 00:43:02,425
-I'm going over there.
-Okay.

571
00:43:07,425 --> 00:43:09,745
MAY YOUR EYES ONLY SEE SMILES

572
00:43:20,825 --> 00:43:24,225
TO: SUN YUANZHU

573
00:43:31,265 --> 00:43:32,105
Are you done?

574
00:43:33,305 --> 00:43:34,305
Done.

575
00:43:36,305 --> 00:43:37,665
You didn't forget anyone?

576
00:43:38,785 --> 00:43:39,985
No. I got them all.

577
00:43:40,065 --> 00:43:41,945
MAY YOU GET PROMOTED SOON. TO: SUN YU

578
00:43:43,785 --> 00:43:44,625
What about me?

579
00:43:50,625 --> 00:43:51,545
You want one too?

580
00:43:51,625 --> 00:43:52,905
What do you think?

581
00:43:53,425 --> 00:43:54,905
I paid for nothing?

582
00:44:05,505 --> 00:44:06,545
Will this work?

583
00:44:31,265 --> 00:44:34,425
WISHING YOU HAPPINESS

584
00:44:36,025 --> 00:44:37,865
I love your handwriting.
I'll take it then.

585
00:44:39,185 --> 00:44:41,265
No need to send it out.
We save the cost of a stamp.

586
00:44:47,305 --> 00:44:48,585
I also get to save the cost of one.

587
00:45:07,105 --> 00:45:10,745
STAY CHEERFUL AND GENUINE FOREVER

